{
  "comment": [
    "Hand-built PRE-REDUCED scan ATPG view (what build_scan_atpg_view emits) for",
    "LOC two-frame transition tests. Two scan FFs lowered to pseudo ports:",
    "  ff0: next-state __ppo_ff0 = A[0] XOR __ppi_ff0  (toggles when A[0]=1 -> Q can transition)",
    "  ff1: next-state __ppo_ff1 = __ppi_ff1        (D=Q hold -> Q can NEVER transition)",
    "  Y    = __ppi_ff0 (real PO observing ff0's Q so a Q-stem fault is detectable)",
    "  Y2   = BUF(A[1]) (purely combinational, no scan FF involvement)",
    "Real PI: A (2 bits -- regression fixture for the held_real_pis multi-bit-PI",
    "bug: build_scan_loc_view must hold BOTH A[0] and A[1] across launch/capture,",
    "not just A[0]). Pseudo-PIs: __ppi_ff0/__ppi_ff1. Pseudo-POs: __ppo_ff0/__ppo_ff1.",
    "A Q-stem (PPI) transition on ff0 is SAT under LOC; on ff1 it is UNSAT (redundant)."
  ],
  "modules": {
    "tiny_scan_view_loc": {
      "attributes": { "top": "00000000000000000000000000000001" },
      "ports": {
        "A": { "direction": "input", "bits": [2, 8] },
        "__ppi_ff0": { "direction": "input", "bits": [3] },
        "__ppi_ff1": { "direction": "input", "bits": [4] },
        "Y": { "direction": "output", "bits": [5] },
        "__ppo_ff0": { "direction": "output", "bits": [6] },
        "__ppo_ff1": { "direction": "output", "bits": [7] },
        "Y2": { "direction": "output", "bits": [9] }
      },
      "cells": {
        "g_xor": {
          "hide_name": 0,
          "type": "sky130_fd_sc_hd__xor2_1",
          "parameters": {},
          "attributes": {},
          "port_directions": { "A": "input", "B": "input", "X": "output" },
          "connections": { "A": [2], "B": [3], "X": [6] }
        },
        "g_buf": {
          "hide_name": 0,
          "type": "sky130_fd_sc_hd__buf_1",
          "parameters": {},
          "attributes": {},
          "port_directions": { "A": "input", "X": "output" },
          "connections": { "A": [3], "X": [5] }
        },
        "g_hold": {
          "hide_name": 0,
          "type": "sky130_fd_sc_hd__buf_1",
          "parameters": {},
          "attributes": {},
          "port_directions": { "A": "input", "X": "output" },
